1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:07,000
When a crop develops a problem, a farmer needs guidance they can understand.

2
00:00:07,200 --> 00:00:14,000
Typing long questions or searching English portals creates digital barriers.

3
00:00:14,200 --> 00:00:17,800
For Karnataka farmers, speaking in Kannada is far simpler.

4
00:00:18,200 --> 00:00:26,000
Meet Krishi Mitra, a Kannada-first agricultural companion for the Gnani AI Challenge.

5
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:33,800
Farmers speak naturally, receive guidance, and listen to answers in their language.

6
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:41,000
A farmer opens the app, chooses Kannada or English, and taps the microphone.

7
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:49,000
Gnani AI converts phone-quality speech into text in real time.

8
00:00:49,200 --> 00:00:57,500
The transcript remains visible for the farmer to verify before submitting.

9
00:00:58,200 --> 00:01:04,800
Groq generates guidance, and Gnani AI reads it aloud. Listen to this Kannada example.

10
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:12,000
[Gnani AI Kannada Audio]: "ಕೃಷಿ ಮಿತ್ರ: ಭತ್ತದ ಬೆಳೆಯಲ್ಲಿ ಎಲೆ ಸುತ್ತುವ ಹುಳು ಕಂಡುಬಂದರೆ, ಮುನ್ನೆಚ್ಚರಿಕೆ ಕ್ರಮಗಳನ್ನು ಕೈಗೊಳ್ಳಿ."
(Translation: "If leaf folder caterpillars appear in paddy, take precautionary measures.")

11
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:21,000
Building this voice pipeline revealed crucial engineering lessons.

12
00:01:21,200 --> 00:01:31,500
We solved audio cutoffs with client-server acknowledgement and crop-state retention.

13
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:40,000
Safety-first: unreviewed chemicals are suppressed; serious issues refer to 1800-180-1551.

14
00:01:40,200 --> 00:01:47,800
Our browser demo is fully operational; telephony integration remains in progress.

15
00:01:48,200 --> 00:01:54,500
Krishi Mitra combines voice input, agricultural intelligence, and spoken answers.

16
00:01:54,700 --> 00:01:59,500
Built with pride for the Gnani AI Great Indian AI Internship Challenge. Thank you.
